219): the names stored through it"] [273 1 "// builtinImportFn is the runtime's builtins.__import__."] [276 1 "// isBuiltinImport is whether o is the runtime's builtins.__import__."] [279 1 "// builtinImport is __import__(name, globals=None, locals=None, fromlist=(), level=0)."] [318 1 "// importName is IMPORT_NAME (importlib's __import__): the module named, relative to globals' package by"] [319 1 "// level; with an empty fromlist the top-level package of the name, else the module with fromlist's"] [320 1 "// submodules imported."] [381 1 "// handleFromlist imports the submodules a package's fromlist names (_handle_fromlist)."] [414 5 "// _handle_fromlist: a missing submodule is skipped, unless sys.modules blocks it with None"] [425 1 "// importFrom is IMPORT_FROM: module.name, else the submodule module.name already in sys.modules (a"] [426 1 "// circular import), else an ImportError."] [458 3 "// import_from's shadowing messages (ceval.c, queue 223): the spec's file origin, else __file__"] [478 2 "// import_from's ImportError: name the module, path its file, name_from the name (PY6b's request)"] [487 1 "// importStar is IMPORT_STAR: __all__'s names, else the module's public names, into ns."] [536 1 "// packageOf is the package a relative import is relative to (import.c's resolve_name, _calc___package__):"] [537 1 "// __package__, checked against __spec__.parent; else __spec__.parent; else, with an ImportWarning, __name__"] [538 1 "// (itself for a package)."] [598 1 "// resolveName is _resolve_name: name relative to package by level."] [614 1 "// importModule is _gcd_import: the module of the absolute name, its parents imported first."] [678 1 "// importBuiltin makes the built-in module name and puts it in sys.modules (ok false when name is not one):"] [679 1 "// the runtime's own import of them, and _imp.create_builtin's under importlib (PY6b)."] [689 23 "// a module whose Go package the host loads on demand (pyexpat)"] [692 25 "// PY6d's R5: the built-in functio